\ Regression: the prelude introspection words `defined?`, `native?`,
\ `word-markers`, and `>word-info` all call `native.current-scope`. When
\ that registry entry lacked a stack effect, the AOT resolver dropped it
\ and pre-scan rejected the four prelude wrappers with NC.11. With the
\ stack effect declared and polymorphic natives surfaced to the resolver,
\ these words now compile and run under --interpreter-fallback=false.
print: defined? .
print: native? .
print: word-markers #len .
